#. 僕の発言とその証拠…
#. 何か矛盾している点でもあるのだろうか？
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You think you have some proof that contradicts what I\n"
"said...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほうほう、なるほど。
#. それはつまり…って全然わかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, I see. So what you're saying is...I have\n"
"absolutely no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんが桑田クンの電子生徒手帳を使った…
#. 確かに、あれを使えば男子更衣室に入れたはずだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Theoretically, if Chihiro was able to use Leon's\n"
"handbook, she could get into the boys locker room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…でも、使えればの話だよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's *if* she was able to use it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんが桑田クンの電子生徒手帳を使った…
#. 確かに、あれを使えば男子更衣室に入れたはずだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Theoretically, if Chihiro was able to use Leon's\n"
"handbook, she could get into the boys locker room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、彼の電子生徒手帳を玄関ホールで見つけた時、
#. あの手帳の状態は確か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But when we found Leon's handbook in the main hall,\n"
"there's no doubt that it was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、彼の電子生徒手帳を使ったって、
#. 考えられるのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In which case, can we really say that she used it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
